From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: qcom: matisse3g: enable GPU and its SMMU

Describe the KGSL SMMU register window, context interrupt and stream ID
from the SM-T531 vendor MSM8226 device tree. Use the existing ARM SMMU
and Adreno drivers. Keep MDSS disabled while the GPU is brought up
independently of the inherited display.

Hardware validation is pending.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-matisse3g.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-matisse3g.dts
@@ -126,3 +126,26 @@
 		bias-disable;
 	};
 };
+
+&soc {
+	gpu_smmu: iommu@fdb10000 {
+		compatible = "qcom,msm8226-smmu", "arm,smmu-v1";
+		reg = <0xfdb10000 0x10000>;
+		#iommu-cells = <1>;
+		#global-interrupts = <1>;
+		interrupts = <GIC_SPI 38 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 241 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 241 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 241 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+		clocks = <&mmcc OXILICX_AHB_CLK>,
+			 <&mmcc OXILICX_AXI_CLK>,
+			 <&mmcc OXILI_GFX3D_CLK>;
+		clock-names = "iface", "bus", "core";
+		power-domains = <&mmcc OXILICX_GDSC>;
+	};
+};
+
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+	iommus = <&gpu_smmu 0>;
+};
